 "descriptionHtml": "<p>The tubogas idea, scaled to one finger. A wide ring of flexible tubogas, about 10mm across the finger, its puffed dome face banded all the way round with fine polished ridges that move like an accordion as the hand bends. No stones, no seams to catch, just a lot of light from one shape. Wear it alone or stacked with a slim band.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear it alone on the index finger, or beside a slim plain band.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Width: Approximately 10mm</li>\n<li>Construction: Flexible tubogas with a puffed dome and fine parallel ridges</li>\n<li>Sizes: US 6, 7 and 8</li>\n<li>Plating: 18k gold tone plated or rhodium plated silver tone (choose above)</li>\n<li>Material: Surgical stainless steel</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Waterproof and tarnish free, so daily wear and water are fine. Keep it away from perfume and harsh chemicals, wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
